@mrbeast My name is Firoz, and I never thought I would have to write a message like this.
A few months ago, I lost my father. Since then, life has completely changed for my family. Along with the grief of losing him, we've been struggling financially, and every day has been incredibly difficult for my mother and me.
My biggest dream right now isn't for myself—it's to give my mother a home where she can feel safe and secure after everything we've been through. I'm trying to raise $50k to help buy a house for her, but I don't have the means to make it happen on my own.  MrBeast please help me buy my mom house you have helped thousands of people so please help me 🙏

STORY: 19 YEARS OLD IN MADAGASCAR NEEDS HELP 🙏 
